[
  {
    "span_id": "e1",
    "source_id": "sgyy-005",
    "chapter": "005",
    "paragraph_index": 21,
    "paragraph_sha256": "5712c2d3f99dfb1d63bc5de28fb7168403c6a8bc3fbab49076189a608c8fb229",
    "char_start": 92,
    "char_end": 143,
    "text": "北海太守孔融部將武安國，使鐵鎚飛馬而出。呂布揮戟拍馬來迎。戰到十餘合，一戟砍斷安國手腕，棄鎚於地而走。",
    "text_sha256": "0f0ce6558684b514909b8ce5eec414224da6944e05ed1ba6bea8ce57b96a017c",
    "partial_sentence": false,
    "review": "pending_human"
  },
  {
    "span_id": "e2",
    "source_id": "sgyy-005",
    "chapter": "005",
    "paragraph_index": 20,
    "paragraph_sha256": "a88ab11e919158d737b732d8ba0131d235e3fb6f20be17f2488607fd7db21617",
    "char_start": 28,
    "char_end": 66,
    "text": "匡視之，乃河內名將方悅。兩馬相交，無五合，被呂布一戟刺於馬下，挺戟直衝過來。",
    "text_sha256": "1ed5755b1697530c02b63d145c14b2f6a180f03aa6ee8e97e0b5a1c3b8592593",
    "partial_sentence": false,
    "review": "pending_human"
  },
  {
    "span_id": "e3",
    "source_id": "sgyy-005",
    "chapter": "005",
    "paragraph_index": 21,
    "paragraph_sha256": "5712c2d3f99dfb1d63bc5de28fb7168403c6a8bc3fbab49076189a608c8fb229",
    "char_start": 57,
    "char_end": 88,
    "text": "上黨太守張楊部將穆順，出馬挺鎗迎戰，被呂布手起一戟，刺於馬下。",
    "text_sha256": "ccbee08dcb8504114814226bb8ee620753ba16fc66878cc29c196b93c35ed9a0",
    "partial_sentence": false,
    "review": "pending_human"
  },
  {
    "span_id": "e4",
    "source_id": "sgyy-005",
    "chapter": "005",
    "paragraph_index": 22,
    "paragraph_sha256": "d7647cc37b65ac2fe7ee70439f900c7bba66115b93b832cb663be4c6854197d9",
    "char_start": 21,
    "char_end": 49,
    "text": "公孫瓚揮槊親戰呂布。戰不數合，瓚敗走。呂布縱赤兔馬趕來。",
    "text_sha256": "926f936073baa1caa403668840b9441671a84d1b02e1c1026af16aaa08877dc3",
    "partial_sentence": false,
    "review": "pending_human"
  },
  {
    "span_id": "e5a",
    "source_id": "sgyy-003",
    "chapter": "003",
    "paragraph_index": 10,
    "paragraph_sha256": "1361d920fff4e16c1e2e8f84deeb5c1f6baa13f0ed4a356989af061343200a90",
    "char_start": 194,
    "char_end": 210,
    "text": "董卓未及回言，呂布飛馬直殺過來。",
    "text_sha256": "568c8090a0ab7e314a99b59f9aafa890556189297af851667023fbdbb73bd441",
    "partial_sentence": false,
    "review": "pending_human"
  },
  {
    "span_id": "e5b",
    "source_id": "sgyy-003",
    "chapter": "003",
    "paragraph_index": 13,
    "paragraph_sha256": "59535e5a4e1805b7b78cca90c17d65790c624bd0e55ccb652165fc19e513b543",
    "char_start": 122,
    "char_end": 213,
    "text": "次日，布持丁原首級，往見李肅。肅遂引布見卓。卓大喜，置酒相待。卓先下拜曰：「卓今得將軍，如旱苗之得甘雨也。」布納卓坐而拜之曰：「公若不棄，布請拜為義父。」卓以金甲錦袍賜布，暢飲而散。",
    "text_sha256": "d647fa72c63926f8c0715ecef94781b01e5b6c4564120879054846fe71b9a650",
    "partial_sentence": false,
    "review": "pending_human"
  },
  {
    "span_id": "e6a",
    "source_id": "sgyy-003",
    "chapter": "003",
    "paragraph_index": 1,
    "paragraph_sha256": "83235d0e3aa8bfb8411557426d2a483a3e68095fc0e9fd1faff1343eda7fac26",
    "char_start": 2,
    "char_end": 16,
    "text": "卻說前將軍斄鄉侯西涼刺史董卓",
    "text_sha256": "d08970d7775aa73021fe796817673cf0b6c8b0623b2ce24019c2f48fbb0db720",
    "partial_sentence": true,
    "review": "pending_human"
  },
  {
    "span_id": "e6b",
    "source_id": "sgyy-003",
    "chapter": "003",
    "paragraph_index": 13,
    "paragraph_sha256": "59535e5a4e1805b7b78cca90c17d65790c624bd0e55ccb652165fc19e513b543",
    "char_start": 213,
    "char_end": 238,
    "text": "卓自是威勢越大，自領前將軍事，封弟董旻為左將軍鄠侯",
    "text_sha256": "d19d4d79043796807dedaf92cded961a974c4060116c7f5a75933304caa3fea5",
    "partial_sentence": true,
    "review": "pending_human"
  },
  {
    "span_id": "e7a",
    "source_id": "sgyy-003",
    "chapter": "003",
    "paragraph_index": 1,
    "paragraph_sha256": "83235d0e3aa8bfb8411557426d2a483a3e68095fc0e9fd1faff1343eda7fac26",
    "char_start": 86,
    "char_end": 99,
    "text": "使其婿中郎將牛輔，守住陝西",
    "text_sha256": "0a8305e6f9b262e8e19f3f76d95980eb98bd68a90724945a914251e3caab07b7",
    "partial_sentence": true,
    "review": "pending_human"
  },
  {
    "span_id": "e8",
    "source_id": "sgyy-009",
    "chapter": "009",
    "paragraph_index": 13,
    "paragraph_sha256": "ede3720588aa51fb40cbe8e41463da3c2d706bfdc2f5e868e72c5e61413c78ac",
    "char_start": 147,
    "char_end": 160,
    "text": "胡赤兒謀殺牛輔，奪其金寶。",
    "text_sha256": "5ec39ffe31446f68cebdf00f8d7ffca9f23093ca71f4d07a4daa5d01f5e3c073",
    "partial_sentence": false,
    "review": "pending_human"
  },
  {
    "span_id": "e9",
    "source_id": "sgyy-007",
    "chapter": "007",
    "paragraph_index": 9,
    "paragraph_sha256": "a445ee7ca81e9bc3b754d313e2415865b921c9e84de657d2459920eb1b8e3b8d",
    "char_start": 2,
    "char_end": 53,
    "text": "卻說孫堅有四子，皆吳夫人所生：長子名策，字伯符；次子名權，字仲謀；三子名翊，字叔弼；四子名匡，字季佐。",
    "text_sha256": "37e17e902d27fddcc48e680d5f1cf8f0f7f088366c87aa2660fe96ffacb55c53",
    "partial_sentence": false,
    "review": "pending_human"
  },
  {
    "span_id": "e10",
    "source_id": "sgyy-002",
    "chapter": "002",
    "paragraph_index": 3,
    "paragraph_sha256": "4a2784161ba705ce727b962d5f6e7bf09e13cc648e5ecc24c2b6b59a9a903477",
    "char_start": 81,
    "char_end": 105,
    "text": "吳郡富春人也：姓孫，名堅，字文臺，乃孫武子之後。",
    "text_sha256": "86b5c193218295ab7cfb9c6e32379ac6fb3946791ef9230fcdf9f4d0a88933f5",
    "partial_sentence": false,
    "review": "pending_human"
  },
  {
    "span_id": "e11",
    "source_id": "sgyy-029",
    "chapter": "029",
    "paragraph_index": 28,
    "paragraph_sha256": "4fd53247da6ad6d91ea55cf96ab3e720182dda36c362387615d58735e33ed632",
    "char_start": 130,
    "char_end": 150,
    "text": "此人姓顧，名雍，子元嘆，乃中郎蔡邕之徒。",
    "text_sha256": "92aacc2da3fca8118a65ff98f4a66caad85d24ade0cccc111161d2748e15740a",
    "partial_sentence": false,
    "review": "pending_human"
  },
  {
    "span_id": "e12",
    "source_id": "sgyy-071",
    "chapter": "071",
    "paragraph_index": 2,
    "paragraph_sha256": "6694ea8cf8284d820b829db1d15042430c443769eab8aa060f5b5e02a20dda7e",
    "char_start": 45,
    "char_end": 61,
    "text": "林木之間，乃蔡邕莊也。今邕女蔡琰",
    "text_sha256": "d30051f90207af4a495c18931650e6f4803723b9cfea818be59bd809ffce850b",
    "partial_sentence": true,
    "review": "pending_human"
  },
  {
    "span_id": "e13a",
    "source_id": "sgyy-071",
    "chapter": "071",
    "paragraph_index": 1,
    "paragraph_sha256": "24631003557a4320ec5e2701c048c48e41a9681b9a0ec63a5db167023a36dd10",
    "char_start": 184,
    "char_end": 192,
    "text": "曹操兵分三路而進",
    "text_sha256": "979632a78f26070fbc67a5b88b312e5946ab1f9fb124afd7ec9f094de21c9bf3",
    "partial_sentence": true,
    "review": "pending_human"
  },
  {
    "span_id": "e13b",
    "source_id": "sgyy-071",
    "chapter": "071",
    "paragraph_index": 2,
    "paragraph_sha256": "6694ea8cf8284d820b829db1d15042430c443769eab8aa060f5b5e02a20dda7e",
    "char_start": 136,
    "char_end": 160,
    "text": "左賢王懼操之勢，送蔡琰還漢。操乃以琰配董祀為妻。",
    "text_sha256": "848e66454de21cfc15f8cac00d3940b4fb7ceb01967efa9214f9464967c2db5c",
    "partial_sentence": false,
    "review": "pending_human"
  }
]
